#: src/nodejs-packagejson-script-compatibility.md:1
msgid "Node.js `package.json` Script Compatibility"
msgstr ""

#: src/nodejs-packagejson-script-compatibility.md:3
msgid ""
"The following export statement gives `just` recipes access to local Node "
"module binaries, and makes `just` recipe commands behave more like `script` "
"entries in Node.js `package.json` files:"
msgstr ""

#: src/nodejs-packagejson-script-compatibility.md:7
msgid ""
"```just\n"
"export PATH := \"./node_modules/.bin:\" + env_var('PATH')\n"
"```"
msgstr ""
